      "name": "InitializeSoundBuffers",
      "signature": "int InitializeSoundBuffers(int nBufferMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initializes DirectSound primary buffer with audio format parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate g_pDSoundPrimary exists\n2. Build WAVEFORMAT structure on stack based on nBufferMode\n3. Call DSoundPrimary->GetFormat (offset 0x10) \n4. If secondary buffer (nBufferMode != 1): call with format data and flags\n5. Set global flag g_pDSoundPrimary_Initialized\n\nParameters:\n- nBufferMode (int): Format mode; 1=primary, other=secondary\n- IMPLICIT: ECX contains nBufferMode (fastcall)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success, 0 on initialization failure",
