      "name": "ConfigureDSoundPrimaryBuffer",
      "signature": "void ConfigureDSoundPrimaryBuffer(int * pDSoundCaps)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Configures DirectSound primary buffer based on global settings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if hardware acceleration enabled and primary buffer exists\n2. If g_dwSomeFlag == 1: Configure flag=1 with DAT_6f9ee228\n3. If g_dwSomeFlag == 2: Configure flag=11 (0xb) with DAT_6f9ee248, 15 additional buffer properties\n4. Set g_fEaxEnabled based on EAX enable value (0xd8f0 constant)\n\nParameters:\n- pDSoundCaps (int*): DirectSound capability structure\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xc, 0x4, 0x8, 0x10, etc.: Offsets into capability structure\n- 0xb (11), 0xf (15): DirectSound property IDs\n- 0xd8f0: EAX enable constant (negate: -10000)\n- 0x10: Function pointer vtable offset",
