      "name": "CloseAllSoundStreams",
      "signature": "void CloseAllSoundStreams(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Closes all active sound streams by iterating through the slot array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwInitialized flag is set\n2. If set, iterate through g_adSlotData array (8 slots)\n3. For each slot, call CloseSoundStream with slot handle\n4. Continue until all slots processed\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: g_dwInitialized (uint) - initialization flag at 0x6f9f3ce0\n- IMPLICIT: g_adSlotData (uint[8]) - array of slot handles at 0x6f9f3ca8\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x6f9f3ca8: Start of slot data array (g_adSlotData)\n- 0x6f9f3cc8: End of slot data array (8 dwords = 32 bytes)\n- 0x4: Stride for dword pointer increment",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
