      "name": "SoundMixerSetValue",
      "signature": "dword SoundMixerSetValue(dword dwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Sets the sound mixer volume value in the registry and stores it globally.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call SetRegistryDword to store the value in Diablo II registry\n2. Store the same value in the global DAT_6f9f3ce8\n3. Return the value\n\nParameters:\n- dwValue (dword): The mixer volume value to set\n\nReturns:\n- The volume value passed in (dwValue)",
