      "name": "AudioThreadWorker",
      "signature": "DWORD AudioThreadWorker(void * pUnused)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Audio Thread Worker - Background thread processing audio stream playback\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Wait for audio event with 50ms timeout (WAIT_TIMEOUT = 0x102)\n2. If timeout, enter critical section and save current tick count\n3. Call GetInitFlag to check audio initialization state\n4. If initialized, call IsIconic to check window minimized state\n5. If minimized, call StartBackgroundMusicPlayback\n6. Iterate through sound object linked list (ppSoundObj)\n7. For each sound object:\n   a. Call IsAudioObjectValid to validate\n   b. Calculate volume with attenuation using CalculateSoundAttenuation\n   c. Apply spatial factor with floating-point math (FLD, FSUBR, FIMUL)\n   d. Convert volume to DirectSound format via __ftol\n   e. Handle volume fading if fade flags active (ESI+0x4c)\n   f. Process streaming audio via GetAudioStreamPosition\n   g. Lock and fill DirectSound buffer with WriteSoundBufferData\n8. Handle stream end conditions and cleanup via SAudCloseStream\n9. Loop back to wait for next audio event\n\nParameters:\n  pUnused (void*): Thread parameter (unused, typically NULL from CreateThread)\n\nReturns:\n  DWORD: Always returns 0 on thread exit\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x102        - WAIT_TIMEOUT result from WaitForSingleObject\n  0x32         - 50ms wait timeout\n  0x80808081   - Magic constant for fast division by 255\n  0x437f0000   - Float 255.0f for volume normalization\n  0x4          - Spatial audio flag in flags byte (ESI+0x34)\n\nStructure Layout (Sound Object at ESI):\n  Offset  Size  Field                 Description\n  0x00    4     pDirectSoundBuffer    IDirectSoundBuffer interface\n  0x04    4     pNextSoundObj         Next in linked list\n  0x08    4     dwBufferSize          Sound buffer byte size\n  0x18    4     dwStreamEnd           Stream end position\n  0x1c    4     dwActiveFlag          Active playback flag\n  0x20    4     dwWritePos            Current write position\n  0x24    4     dwReadPos             Current read position\n  0x28    4     dwBufferState         Buffer fill state (0/1)\n  0x2c    4     dwStreamMode          Streaming mode flags\n  0x30    4     dwFillAmount          Bytes to fill\n  0x34    1     bFlags                Audio flags (bit 2 = spatial)\n  0x38    4     dwVolume              Current volume level\n  0x3c    4     flSpatialFactor       Spatial attenuation factor\n  0x40    4     dwReserved            Reserved\n  0x48    4     hStreamHandle         Audio stream file handle\n  0x4c    4     dwFadeActive          Fade in/out active\n  0x50    4     nFadeStartVol         Fade start volume\n  0x54    4     nFadeEndVol           Fade end volume\n  0x58    4     dwFadeStartTime       Fade start tick\n  0x5c    4     dwFadeEndTime         Fade end tick\n\nCritical Section: g_csAudioObjects at 0x6f9f3c50\n\nError Handling:\n  Calls FogAssert with file/line info on null pointer dereference\n  Multiple assertion points at lines 0x286, 0x2bf, 0x3f4, 0x14b\n\nDecompiler Limitations:\n  pfnEnterCS - Decompiler infers as undefined* due to indirect call pattern\n  abPadding - Stack alignment bytes (undefined1[4]) cannot be retyped\n  extraout_var - SSA phantom variable for extended register output",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
