      "name": "InitializeAudioStreaming",
      "signature": "void InitializeAudioStreaming(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize DirectSound audio streaming with stream count and game object creation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query DirectSound stream count via Ordinal_10002 (Storm.dll ordinal)\n2. Configure stream count with SetAudioStreamCount\n3. Create primary game object for audio playback with CreateGameObject\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: DirectSound configuration globals (from InitializeDirectSound context)\n\nReturns:\n- void (initializes global audio state g_pAudioGameObject)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeDirectSound (parent initialization)\n- SetAudioStreamCount (stream configuration)\n- CreateGameObject (audio object creation)",
