      "name": "ShutdownAudioGameObject",
      "signature": "void ShutdownAudioGameObject(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Shuts down audio resources by closing the game audio object and terminating all audio streams.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_pAudioGameObject is initialized (non-null)\n2. If initialized, close the audio object and set reference to null\n3. Shut down all active audio streams\n4. Return\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: g_pAudioGameObject - Pointer to the game audio object\n\nReturns:\n- void",
