      "name": "InitializeWaveFormat",
      "signature": "void InitializeWaveFormat(dword * pWaveFormat, short nMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize DirectSound WAVEFORMATEX structure with format parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear first 5 dwords (20 bytes) of structure\n2. Set cbSize field to (param_2 * 2)\n3. Set wFormatTag to 1 (PCM format)\n4. Set dwSamplesPerSec field to 0x5622 (22050 Hz)\n5. Calculate dwAvgBytesPerSec from (param_2 * 2) * 0x5622\n6. Set nBlockAlign and nChannels based on param_2\n\nParameters:\n- pWaveFormat (uint*): Pointer to WAVEFORMATEX structure (minimum 20 bytes)\n- nMode (short): Mode selector (1 or 2) controls channel/sample configuration\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x5622 (22050): Sample rate in Hz (22.05 kHz)\n- 0x1: PCM format tag constant",
