      "name": "LinkedListContains",
      "signature": "int LinkedListContains(int * pNode, int nValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Searches a linked list for a specific value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pNode is non-NULL (handle empty list)\n2. Loop through linked list nodes via pNode[1] (next pointer)\n3. Compare *pNode with target nValue\n4. Return 1 if match found, 0 if list exhausted\n\nParameters:\n- pNode (int *): Pointer to first linked list node (or NULL)\n- nValue (int): Value to search for in list\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if nValue found in list, 0 if not found or list empty\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- Index [1]: Next pointer offset in node structure",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
