      "name": "GetFileVersionInfo",
      "signature": "dword GetFileVersionInfo(LPCSTR lpszFilePath, dword * pdwMajorVersion, dword * pdwMinorVersion, dword * pdwBuildNumber)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Extracts file version information from executable version resource.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read file into buffer (dwFileSize initially 0, grows to actual size on retry)\n2. If error code 0x7A (insufficient buffer), allocate memory and re-read\n3. Query version resource using VerQueryValueA\n4. Extract major/minor/build from VS_FIXEDFILEINFO structure (offset +8, +C)\n5. Return 1 on success, 0 on failure\n\nParameters:\n- lpszFilePath (LPCSTR): Path to file containing version resource\n- pdwMajorVersion (dword*): Output buffer for major version (bits 31:16)\n- pdwMinorVersion (dword*): Output buffer for minor version (bits 15:0 of same field)\n- pdwBuildNumber (dword*): Output buffer for build number (bits 15:0)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on successful version extraction\n- 0 if file cannot be read or version resource missing\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x7A (122): ERROR_INSUFFICIENT_BUFFER - file size exceeded initial read\n- 0x10: Right-shift to extract major version from high word\n- 0xFFFF: Mask to extract low word (minor/build)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:022bda5ee6c9a9a553d32a723b8a3b0ee44f699ae9e829095aa66d50911826b1",
