      "name": "ProcessParameterValue",
      "signature": "void ProcessParameterValue(int nParamType)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets parameter type code at global location.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6f9ec871() to get pointer to parameter type location\n2. Write 0x21 if nParamType == 1\n3. Write 0x22 if 1 < nParamType < 4\n\nParameters:\n- nParamType (int): Parameter type identifier (1=X, 2-3=Y)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x21 (33): Type code for single value\n- 0x22 (34): Type code for range 2-3",
