      "name": "InitializeMusicTrackState",
      "signature": "void InitializeMusicTrackState(uint dwSoundQueueTime)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes music track state for background playback system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if dwSoundQueueTime is non-zero and system not already initialized (g_dwLastSoundQueueTime == 0)\n2. If first initialization, iterate through all stream tracks (0 to g_nStreamTrackCount)\n3. On first loop iteration, if g_fMusicFlagInitialized is 0, call GetMusicIntroFlag() and cache result\n4. Validate track count consistency with g_nStreamTrackValidation (assert on mismatch)\n5. Validate loop index is within bounds (assert on overflow)\n6. Select track table based on intro flag: intro tracks (0x6f9f0838) or common tracks (0x6f9f07f0)\n7. Clear second pointer in each track entry (ppTrackEntry[1] = NULL)\n8. After loop, set g_nCurrentTrackSelection = 1\n9. Always store dwSoundQueueTime in g_dwLastSoundQueueTime\n\nParameters:\n- dwSoundQueueTime (ECX, uint): Sound queue timestamp; non-zero triggers initialization\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- No-op if dwSoundQueueTime is 0\n- No-op if already initialized (g_dwLastSoundQueueTime non-zero)\n- Asserts and exits with -1 if track count validation fails\n- Asserts and exits with -1 if loop index exceeds track count\n\nRelated Globals:\n- g_dwLastSoundQueueTime (0x6f9f3d14): Last queue time, guards re-initialization\n- g_nStreamTrackCount (0x6f9f0830): Number of music stream tracks\n- g_fMusicFlagInitialized (0x6f9f3d1c): One-shot flag for intro mode caching\n- g_nMusicIntroFlagCache (0x6f9f3d20): Cached intro mode flag from GetMusicIntroFlag()\n- g_nStreamTrackValidation (0x6f9f0878): Expected track count for validation\n- g_nCurrentTrackSelection (0x6f9f3d18): Current track index, set to 1 after init\n\nOrdinal: 10034",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
